{"id":"52abdd87e34f04ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Cut And Choose Game","display":"df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game — ZFC Game2 Cut And Choose Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game — ZFC Game2 Cut And Choose Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-complete-boolean.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-cut-and-choose-game — ZFC Game2 Cut And Choose Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"258c3795028ee0ac\" href=\"?note=258c3795028ee0ac\" title=\"58-df-complete-boolean.md\">58-df-complete-boolean.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1 \\in V\">\\(G,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1 \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\)</span> is the six-place predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"258c3795028ee0ac\" href=\"?note=258c3795028ee0ac\" title=\"58-df-complete-boolean.md\">58-df-complete-boolean.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{p,b,i}\">\\(c_{p,b,i}\\)</span> are the derived order and selected-piece sequence defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2CutAndChooseGame}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2CutAndChooseGame}_S\\)</span> is the seven-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B\\;\\bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbb B}y\\leftrightarrow x\\wedge y=x\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B\\;\\bigl(x\\leq_{\\mathbb B}y\\leftrightarrow x\\wedge y=x\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}selected\\text{-}pieces} \\vdash c_{p,b,i}\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}b(n),&amp;i(n)=0,\\\\p\\wedge\\neg b(n),&amp;i(n)=1\\end{cases}:n\\in\\omega\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}selected\\text{-}pieces} \\vdash c_{p,b,i}\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\begin{cases}b(n),&amp;i(n)=0,\\\\p\\wedge\\neg b(n),&amp;i(n)=1\\end{cases}:n\\in\\omega\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}cut\\text{-}and\\text{-}choose\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2CutAndChooseGame}_S(G,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land G=\\left\\langle\\{\\langle p,b,i\\rangle:p\\in\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land b\\in\\mathbb B^\\omega\\land i\\in2^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b(n)\\leq_{\\mathbb B}p)\\},\\{\\langle p,b,i\\rangle:p\\in\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land b\\in\\mathbb B^\\omega\\land i\\in2^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b(n)\\leq_{\\mathbb B}p)\\land\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}c_{p,b,i}(n)=0\\}\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}cut\\text{-}and\\text{-}choose\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2CutAndChooseGame}_S(G,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land G=\\left\\langle\\{\\langle p,b,i\\rangle:p\\in\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land b\\in\\mathbb B^\\omega\\land i\\in2^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b(n)\\leq_{\\mathbb B}p)\\},\\{\\langle p,b,i\\rangle:p\\in\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land b\\in\\mathbb B^\\omega\\land i\\in2^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(b(n)\\leq_{\\mathbb B}p)\\land\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}c_{p,b,i}(n)=0\\}\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom fixes the convention that the cutting player wins exactly when the meet of the pieces selected by the choosing player is zero.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complete-boolean.md","status":"resolved","id":"258c3795028ee0ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complete-boolean.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complete-boolean.md","status":"re